    "Golden vectors for the owner-signed melusina.store-host-facts.v1 digest: sha256(domain || preimage), lowercase hex.",
    "preimage is the facts document as compact JSON in fieldOrder with the top-level signatures left out; an omitted optional field (rpcFallbackUrls, rpcTlsSpkiPins) is absent, so documents signed before rpcTlsSpkiPins existed keep their digest.",
    "The deployer (deploy-ui/internal/storehost StoreHostFactsDigest, the producer and verifier) and the Store (cmd/verify-installer-release, the chain-read consumer) each carry this file byte for byte and assert every vector.",
    "Every value is a fixture: digests are sha256 of fixed 'store-test-fixture:' labels and the signatures are placeholder strings that the digest excludes. None names anything that exists."
